ss=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看可升级的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> outdated</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"brewfile-声明式环境管理\">Brewfile 声明式环境管理</h3><p>Brewfile 是 Homebrew 的声明式配置文件，类似于 <code>package.json</code> 对于 Node.js 的作用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ruby\" data-code=\"# ~/dotfiles/Brewfile&#10;&#10;# === Taps ===&#10;tap &quot;homebrew/bundle&quot;&#10;tap &quot;nikitabobko/tap&quot;  # Aerospace 窗口管理器&#10;&#10;# === CLI 必备工具 ===&#10;brew &quot;git&quot;&#10;brew &quot;gh&quot;              # GitHub CLI&#10;brew &quot;stow&quot;            # Dotfiles 管理&#10;brew &quot;starship&quot;        # Shell 提示符&#10;brew &quot;mise&quot;            # 运行时版本管理&#10;&#10;# === 现代 CLI 替代品 ===&#10;brew &quot;eza&quot;             # 替代 ls&#10;brew &quot;bat&quot;             # 替代 cat&#10;brew &quot;fd&quot;              # 替代 find&#10;brew &quot;ripgrep&quot;         # 替代 grep&#10;brew &quot;fzf&quot;             # 模糊搜索&#10;brew &quot;zoxide&quot;          # 智能 cd&#10;brew &quot;delta&quot;           # 替代 diff&#10;brew &quot;dust&quot;            # 替代 du&#10;brew &quot;btop&quot;            # 替代 top&#10;brew &quot;httpie&quot;          # 替代 curl&#10;brew &quot;jq&quot;              # JSON 处理&#10;brew &quot;yq&quot;              # YAML 处理&#10;brew &quot;tldr&quot;            # 替代 man&#10;&#10;# === 开发工具 ===&#10;brew &quot;neovim&quot;&#10;brew &quot;tmux&quot;&#10;brew &quot;lazygit&quot;&#10;brew &quot;docker-compose&quot;&#10;&#10;# === 语言运行时（通过 mise 管理版本，这里装最新稳定版） ===&#10;brew &quot;node&quot;&#10;brew &quot;python@3.13&quot;&#10;brew &quot;go&quot;&#10;brew &quot;rust&quot;&#10;&#10;# === GUI 应用 ===&#10;cask &quot;ghostty&quot;&#10;cask &quot;visual-studio-code&quot;&#10;cask &quot;raycast&quot;&#10;cask &quot;1password&quot;&#10;cask &quot;docker&quot;&#10;cask &quot;firefox&quot;&#10;cask &quot;aerospace&quot;       # 平铺窗口管理&#10;&#10;# === 字体 ===&#10;cask &quot;font-jetbrains-mono-nerd-font&quot;&#10;cask &quot;font-fira-code-nerd-font&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/dotfiles/Brewfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># === Taps ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tap </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"homebrew/bundle\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tap </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nikitabobko/tap\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Aerospace 窗口管理器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># === CLI 必备工具 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">brew </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"git\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">brew </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gh\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # GitHub CLI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">brew </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stow\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # Dotfiles 管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">brew </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"starship\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # Shell 提示符</span></span>\n