开销</strong>：设置 <code>HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1</code>，把自动索引更新改为按需手动执行</li>\n<li><strong>回收磁盘空间</strong>：定期执行 <code>brew cleanup</code> 和 <code>brew autoremove</code>，删除旧版本缓存与孤立依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 并行下载（加速 brew upgrade）&#10;export HOMEBREW_CURL_RETRIES=3&#10;&#10;# 关闭自动更新（每次 install 前不自动 brew update）&#10;export HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1&#10;&#10;# 定期手动更新&#10;brew update &amp;&amp; brew upgrade&#10;&#10;# 清理磁盘空间&#10;brew cleanup              # 删除旧版本缓存&#10;brew cleanup --prune=7    # 保留 7 天内的缓存&#10;brew autoremove           # 删除不再需要的依赖&#10;&#10;# 检查磁盘占用&#10;brew --cache              # 缓存目录&#10;du -sh $(brew --cache)    # 缓存大小&#10;du -sh /opt/homebrew      # Homebrew 总占用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 并行下载（加速 brew upgrade）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HOMEBREW_CURL_RETRIES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关闭自动更新（每次 install 前不自动 brew update）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 定期手动更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;